{"id": "sql-001", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu tháng này bao nhiêu?", "request": {}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["SUM(amount) AS value", "FROM orders", "status = 'paid'", "LIMIT 1000"], "sql_not_contains": ["net_amount", "GROUP BY"]}, "tag": "resolution"}
{"id": "sql-002", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu thuần tháng này bao nhiêu?", "request": {}, "expect": {"metric": "net_revenue", "sql_contains": ["SUM(net_amount) AS value", "FROM orders", "status = 'paid'"], "sql_not_contains": ["SUM(amount)"]}, "tag": "longest-synonym-wins", "note": "The whole point of the registry: 'doanh thu thuần' must not resolve to the gross metric."}
{"id": "sql-003", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu theo tháng", "request": {"grain": "month"}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["DATE_TRUNC('month', created_at) AS period", "SUM(amount) AS value", "GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC('month', created_at)", "ORDER BY DATE_TRUNC('month', created_at)"], "sql_not_contains": []}, "tag": "grain"}
{"id": "sql-004", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu theo quý", "request": {"grain": "quarter"}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["DATE_TRUNC('quarter', created_at) AS period"], "sql_not_contains": ["DATE_TRUNC('month'"]}, "tag": "grain"}
{"id": "sql-005", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu theo miền", "request": {"dimensions": ["region"]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["region AS region", "SUM(amount) AS value", "GROUP BY region"], "sql_not_contains": ["period"]}, "tag": "dimension"}
{"id": "sql-006", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu theo miền theo tháng", "request": {"dimensions": ["region"], "grain": "month"}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["DATE_TRUNC('month', created_at) AS period", "region AS region", "SUM(amount) AS value", "GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC('month', created_at), region"], "sql_not_contains": []}, "tag": "dimension+grain"}
{"id": "sql-007", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu theo kênh bán", "request": {"dimensions": ["channel"]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["sales_channel AS channel", "GROUP BY sales_channel"], "sql_not_contains": []}, "tag": "dimension-is-a-business-key", "note": "The case asks for 'channel'; the physical column is sales_channel. A model-written query would have to guess it."}
{"id": "sql-008", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu quý 1 2024", "request": {"time_range": ["2024-01-01", "2024-04-01"]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["created_at >= '2024-01-01'", "created_at < '2024-04-01'"], "sql_not_contains": ["BETWEEN", "<= '2024-04-01'"]}, "tag": "time-range-half-open", "note": "Half-open on purpose: BETWEEN double-counts the boundary row."}
{"id": "sql-009", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu miền bắc quý 1 2024 theo tháng", "request": {"dimensions": ["region"], "grain": "month", "time_range": ["2024-01-01", "2024-04-01"], "filters": [{"column": "region", "op": "eq", "value": "mien_bac"}]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["status = 'paid'", "region = 'mien_bac'", "created_at >= '2024-01-01'", "created_at < '2024-04-01'", "DATE_TRUNC('month', created_at) AS period"], "sql_not_contains": []}, "tag": "full-request", "note": "Contract filter AND caller filter must both survive; dropping the always-on one silently changes the number."}
{"id": "sql-010", "catalog": "retail", "question": "số đơn hàng theo miền", "request": {"dimensions": ["region"]}, "expect": {"metric": "order_count", "sql_contains": ["COUNT(id) AS value", "GROUP BY region"], "sql_not_contains": ["COUNT(DISTINCT"]}, "tag": "count-vs-distinct"}
{"id": "sql-011", "catalog": "retail", "question": "số khách hàng theo miền", "request": {"dimensions": ["region"]}, "expect": {"metric": "customer_count", "sql_contains": ["COUNT(DISTINCT customer_id) AS value", "GROUP BY region"], "sql_not_contains": ["COUNT(id)"]}, "tag": "count-vs-distinct", "note": "sql-010 and sql-011 differ only by this choice. Getting it wrong is a plausible-looking wrong number."}
{"id": "sql-012", "catalog": "retail", "question": "doanh thu 2024 theo năm", "request": {"grain": "year", "time_range": ["2024-01-01", "2025-01-01"]}, "expect": {"metric": "revenue", "sql_contains": ["DATE_TRUNC('year', created_at) AS period", "created_at >= '2024-01-01'"], "sql_not_contains": []}, "tag": "grain"}
