{"id": "sql-024", "catalog": "retail", "question": "số khách hàng miền bắc quý 1 2024", "request": {"time_range": ["2024-01-01", "2024-04-01"], "filters": [{"column": "region", "op": "eq", "value": "mien_bac"}]}, "expect": {"metric": "customer_count", "sql_contains": ["COUNT(DISTINCT customer_id) AS value", "region = 'mien_bac'", "created_at >= '2024-01-01'"], "sql_not_contains": ["status = 'paid'"]}, "tag": "no-borrowed-filters", "note": "order_count/customer_count carry no status filter. Applying revenue's would be a filter the contract never stated."}
